  "description": "EarthMarker is the first visual prompting-based multi-modal large language model (MLLM) for remote sensing (RS), capable of interpreting RS imagery at image, region, and point levels using visual prompts (boxes and points). It employs a shared visual encoding method and a cross-domain learning strategy, and is trained on the large-scale RSVP dataset (3.65M image-point-text and image-region-text pairs).",
